    {
      "id": "manual-573-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This page begins the Volume I index and is reference material rather than narrative. It opens under A with entries such as Aali Singh, Abhimanyu, Achal Batala, Ahmad Shah Abdali, Amritsar, Anandpur Sahib, and Aurangzeb."
    },
    {
      "id": "manual-573-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The B entries include Baaj Singh, Baba Kahan Singh, Babur, Bachittar Singh, Baghar Singh, Bahadur Shah, Baijid Khan, Banda Bahadur, Bedi, Bhagwati, Binod Singh, Bulaka Singh, and related references."
    },
    {
      "id": "manual-573-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The page continues into later alphabetical entries such as Daya Singh Sobti, Dayal Singh, Deep Singh, Dharam Singh, Fateh Singh, and other names. Its purpose is to help readers locate people, places, and topics in Volume I."
    }
  ],
